<title>CANADA: A &amp; A Foods sets one-for-five reverse split.</title>
<headline>A &amp; A Foods sets one-for-five reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>PORT COQUITLAM, B.C. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A &amp; A Foods Ltd said on Tuesday its shareholders authorized a one-for-five reverse stock split.</p>
<p>The company said in a news release that the split would reduce its issued share capital to 2.2 million shares from 11 million.</p>
<p>The company also said shareholders approved a name change to A &amp; A International Industries Inc, presuming that name is approved by the company directors and by regulatory authorities.</p>
</text>
